  abilityName: Baldr's Cleave
  abilityDesc: 23 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    damage taken may restore HP for 3 turns, activates Taunt and boosts own Def,
    adds Fire barrier, 50% damage reduction for 3 turns & 25% DoT reduction for 2
    turns
